{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM THE CO-CREATOR OF NUCLEAR THRONE, LUFTRAUSERS, RIDICULOUS FISHING.</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Posting: Mercenary Needed. Payment on delivery.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard, mercenary! We have one simple company motto here: <strong>Cargo delivery is mandatory. Repairs are optional.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody knows what caused it, but decades ago a catastrophic event dried up the Atlantic Ocean, leaving behind a hostile wasteland crawling with oversized bugs, reanimated ancient weapons, and bizarre mutated creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Escort our clients\u2019 precious cargo across this hostile terrain by train. You\u2019ll hold off endless waves of enemies at every station. If the shipment arrives intact, we\u2019ll call it a win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Australia Did It doesn\u2019t just play with genres......it creates one. Enter the <strong>Tactical Reverse Bullet Hell</strong>, where thoughtful Turn-Based Tower Defense is enhanced by a unique unit merging system and explosive, pulse-pounding on-rails Reverse Bullet Hell Combat. Carefully strategize to withstand relentless enemy waves, then unleash sensory overload as you become the Bullet Hell, mowing down thousands in dazzling chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Responsibilities:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/e65cf42fe7217c5c95f549e6bdcb43a8.poster.avif?t=1771943174\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/e65cf42fe7217c5c95f549e6bdcb43a8.webm?t=1771943174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND YOUR STATION</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the train departs, strategically deploy and position your limited units to hold off relentless waves of enemies. Think chess, but faster and with potentially explosive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/547f448a209041b103a13d9de79b087f.poster.avif?t=1771943174\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/547f448a209041b103a13d9de79b087f.webm?t=1771943174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVE YOUR UNITS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge units on the fly to unlock 1,500+ combinations across 30+ unit types. Create ridiculously powerful new units or niche specialists. Experimentation is key\u2026.. just try not to blow yourself up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/c2d93ecb15af9579fba52dac2c440780.poster.avif?t=1771943174\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/c2d93ecb15af9579fba52dac2c440780.webm?t=1771943174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE REVERSE BULLET HELL</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the train\u2019s moving, chaos begins. Engage in intense on-rail battles where you <strong>become the bullet hell</strong>, mowing down thousands in sensory-overload shootouts. Remember, only the cargo\u2019s survival is mandatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/75c62867c9d07eb278549d043dfba28c.poster.avif?t=1771943174\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/75c62867c9d07eb278549d043dfba28c.webm?t=1771943174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR STRATEGIES</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each successful station, choose from special Reward Cards that grant unique perks and boosts. Craft unique builds by mixing cards with your evolving crew for creative new strategies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Tower Defense with fast-paced planning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse Bullet Hell combat where offense = survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge System with 1,500+ unit combinations &amp; 30+ unit types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep run-to-run customization through Reward cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unlockable Trains Models with unique stats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interested? Apply Today!</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0openings available daily and unexpectedly. Training optional. No long-term commitment required</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now to be notified when duty calls.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2396130?t=1771943174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/54bc18e9a2a1512c3ffbf4832a45707c9a492814/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771943174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/97261bc2586a2c60b1e89349afcb591bdec6618f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771943174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/97261bc2586a2c60b1e89349afcb591bdec6618f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771943174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3859010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/de76e247cb37d558750292d532f1a1e3.avif?t=1771943174\" width=780 height=158 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM THE CO-CREATOR OF NUCLEAR THRONE, LUFTRAUSERS, RIDICULOUS FISHING.</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Posting: Mercenary Needed. Payment on delivery.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard, mercenary! We have one simple company motto here: <strong>Cargo delivery is mandatory. Repairs are optional.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody knows what caused it, but decades ago a catastrophic event dried up the Atlantic Ocean, leaving behind a hostile wasteland crawling with oversized bugs, reanimated ancient weapons, and bizarre mutated creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Escort our clients\u2019 precious cargo across this hostile terrain by train. You\u2019ll hold off endless waves of enemies at every station. If the shipment arrives intact, we\u2019ll call it a win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Australia Did It doesn\u2019t just play with genres......it creates one. Enter the <strong>Tactical Reverse Bullet Hell</strong>, where thoughtful Turn-Based Tower Defense is enhanced by a unique unit merging system and explosive, pulse-pounding on-rails Reverse Bullet Hell Combat. Carefully strategize to withstand relentless enemy waves, then unleash sensory overload as you become the Bullet Hell, mowing down thousands in dazzling chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Responsibilities:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/e65cf42fe7217c5c95f549e6bdcb43a8.poster.avif?t=1771943174\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/e65cf42fe7217c5c95f549e6bdcb43a8.webm?t=1771943174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND YOUR STATION</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the train departs, strategically deploy and position your limited units to hold off relentless waves of enemies. Think chess, but faster and with potentially explosive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/547f448a209041b103a13d9de79b087f.poster.avif?t=1771943174\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/547f448a209041b103a13d9de79b087f.webm?t=1771943174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVE YOUR UNITS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge units on the fly to unlock 1,500+ combinations across 30+ unit types. Create ridiculously powerful new units or niche specialists. Experimentation is key\u2026.. just try not to blow yourself up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/c2d93ecb15af9579fba52dac2c440780.poster.avif?t=1771943174\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/c2d93ecb15af9579fba52dac2c440780.webm?t=1771943174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE REVERSE BULLET HELL</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the train\u2019s moving, chaos begins. Engage in intense on-rail battles where you <strong>become the bullet hell</strong>, mowing down thousands in sensory-overload shootouts. Remember, only the cargo\u2019s survival is mandatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/75c62867c9d07eb278549d043dfba28c.poster.avif?t=1771943174\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/extras/75c62867c9d07eb278549d043dfba28c.webm?t=1771943174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR STRATEGIES</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each successful station, choose from special Reward Cards that grant unique perks and boosts. Craft unique builds by mixing cards with your evolving crew for creative new strategies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Tower Defense with fast-paced planning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse Bullet Hell combat where offense = survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge System with 1,500+ unit combinations &amp; 30+ unit types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep run-to-run customization through Reward cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unlockable Trains Models with unique stats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interested? Apply Today!</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0openings available daily and unexpectedly. Training optional. No long-term commitment required</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now to be notified when duty calls.</strong></h2>","developers":["Rami Ismail","Aesthetician Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396130/e57abbbf1dabf4c72d0feb3da6923fcb2af25bb6/header.jpg?t=1771943174","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.7 and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1,3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor